  "managementDiscussion": "In fiscal year FY2026, ITC Limited recorded revenue of \u20b90.98 lakh crore, growing 10.0% year-on-year, driven by continued momentum across FMCG - Cigarettes, FMCG - Others. Net income stood at \u20b90.26 lakh crore with a net margin of 27.0% and a return on equity of 29.0%. Operating cash flow remained robust at \u20b90.30 lakh crore, supporting capital expenditure of \u20b90.05 lakh crore and a free cash flow of \u20b90.25 lakh crore. The company maintains a measured capital structure with net debt-to-equity of -0.05x. Management continues to invest in digital and AI capabilities, expects sustained volume-led growth and disciplined cost control, and remains committed to value-accretive capital allocation and sustainable returns for shareholders.",
